OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: clearer joystick and gimbal controls over bright footage; experimental Multiview for up to four cameras; LEVEL and Double-tap Level; Osmo Action 6 support (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Live View crash, Nano zoom controls and clip deletion fixes, plus about 65% less Live View CPU use. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
